The Wrenford commune is an agrarian village on the outskirts of [[Geography/Calaria/Wrenford|Wrenford]], between the city and the [[Verdant Expanse]]. About thirty people live there, in wood and thatch houses that look built for a historical reenactment until you notice people living in them.

The commune is devout to the [[Green Father]]. Its people keep sheep and farm, wear tunics, and refuse recent inventions and anything they judge too far from a natural state. They do not wear jewellery. No door is locked, none of them see any point in lying, and the sort of person who would do dishonest things would not choose to live there. They respect authority and will not stand in the way of a warrant.

A twenty-minute walk from the city reaches the commune's edge.
